# ar-credit
ok 1 - a 12,000.00 balance on a 10,000.00 limit is 120 per cent used with 2,000.00 of excess -- REQ: AR-008, AR-022
ok 2 - the account is reported as over its credit limit -- REQ: AR-008
ok 3 - an active override of 5,000.00 restores 3,000.00 of headroom -- REQ: AR-008, D-06
ok 4 - forty days past due reaches the account stop stage and is workable -- REQ: AR-016, D-06
ok 5 - a wholly disputed item is suppressed from the chase with a reason -- REQ: AR-015, AR-016
ok 6 - the dispute does not reduce credit exposure -- REQ: AR-015, AC: a dispute does not erase debt
ok 7 - a partial dispute still allows the undisputed 8,000.00 to be collected -- REQ: AR-015, AR-016
ok 8 - a contact restriction suppresses the collection step -- REQ: AR-016, AR-028
ok 9 - an open promise to pay suppresses the chase until its date -- REQ: AR-015, AR-016
ok 10 - an item settled before issue is not chased -- REQ: AR-016, AC: reminders are not sent for settled amounts
ok 11 - an account on hold is reported as held -- REQ: AR-008, D-06
# ar-credit done
